{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Agent Structure — v0.1 design\n\nOrganization implemented; full context is pass 4 and temporary lifecycle is pass 5.\n\n[[Harness Design]] · [[Memory & Context.canvas]]\n[[Repository Access.canvas]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -640,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "identity",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## identity.md\n\nPersonality in every mode, including Temporary.\nNo user-specific memory.\n\nAgent edits require approval in Shared; blocked in Closed.",
      "x": -560,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## memory.md\n\nConfirmed durable user facts/preferences.\nManual and agent edits have equal standing.\nUse current eligible contents each model call.\nTrack sources; user can inspect/edit.",
      "x": -560,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "notes",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## notes/\n\nReusable procedures and evidenced research.\nAutomatic scoped updates when useful.\n\nClosed cannot read/write global notes. Temporary contributes none.",
      "x": -560,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "agent",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Agent\n\nOwn folder, identity and user memory.\n\nSections organize every chat.\nNo subagents in this version.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "general",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## General — single built-in section\n\nAlways Shared; cannot delete or contain projects.\n\nPermanent chats and temporary chats sit together. No separate Temporary section.",
      "x": 560,
      "y": -340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "club",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Computer Science Club — section\n\nCannot own a repository.\nClosed → Shared only.\nClosed chats cannot leave until the whole section becomes Shared.\nProjects stay in this section.",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "generalchats",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Permanent General chats\n\nChat 1\nChat 2\n\nNo expiry. Normal scoped memory rules apply.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": -340,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "tempchat",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Temporary retention\n\nDirectly under a section, never a project.\nRead section/project context.\nNo durable memory or shared summaries.\nKeep, then separately move into a repo project before editing.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "direct",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Direct section chats\n\nPlan club events\nResearch computer science\nTemporary research chat\n\nTemporary chats read context for this section and its projects.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "website",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Club Website — project\n\nOne current repo; external or internal.\nMember chats have read/write access.\nChats cannot leave; no detach to chat-only.\nMissing folder may be relinked (D-061).",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "planning",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Planning — chat-only project\n\nStays in its parent section.\nMay gain one repository later.\nThen all existing chats become bound to the project.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "codechats",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Website chats — bound to project\n\nFrontend chat\nBackend chat\nAnother frontend chat\n\nCannot move outside Club Website.",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "planchats",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Planning chats\n\nPossible event topics\nDiscuss slides",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "rec",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Context and repository access\n\nSection → conversation context.\nShared repo → all agent chats may read.\nClosed repo → same-section reads only.\nProject membership → read/write, no per-edit prompts.\nProjects cannot move sections.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_skills",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Skills — current / pass 5\n\nCurrent: user-managed skills/ packages.\nPass 5: requested imports in tools/skills/, with SKILL.md + resources.\nImport grants no execution.\n\n[[Tools & Permissions]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "container_delete",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Delete a container — D-059\n\nStop/settle descendant work.\nDelete actual folder tree + DB chats.\nCode physically inside is deleted too.\nExternal linked folders survive.\n\n[[Container & Settings.canvas]]",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
